# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase (REQUIRED)
#
# Authentication runs entirely on Supabase Auth email OTP -- there is no
# backend server to deploy. Both values come from your Supabase project under
# Project Settings -> API.
#
# NOTE: VITE_* variables are inlined into the bundle at BUILD time, so changing
# them in Vercel requires a redeploy before the running app picks them up.
# The anon key is a public, browser-safe key; access is governed by Row Level
# Security. Never put the service_role key in a VITE_ variable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
